are token does not identify that sodium/quantity/CO2 preparation independently of the footnote. Retain its exact sourced REJECTED_LABEL entry as a non-name for this specific owner, while retaining the positive source-occurrence assignment and source-supported NBRC1257/NBRC1321 union. No competing preferred owner of either exact token was found in the explicitly checked current mapped directory and worker01 proposal set, so no owned-name suppression is proposed. These dispositions concern name applicability to this specific preparation, not rejection of bicarbonate as a material. The reported 1.0 M remains nominal: 100 mL is added water, not verified final solution volume; dissolved CO2 amount/speciation is unquantified. Carbon dioxide remains a source-listed material input because the solution is explicitly saturated, independently of the CO2 headspace condition.",
